WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:01.780
- I don't know how to describe

00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:03.540
being awkward, but I just ...

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:08.134
Didn't answer that well.

00:00:08.134 --> 00:00:10.050
(laughs awkwardly)

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:11.515
(squeaking)

00:00:11.515 --> 00:00:12.348
- (laughs nervously)

00:00:12.348 --> 00:00:13.181
I'm Emily.

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:15.640
Hi, I'm Emily.

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:17.360
I'm a socially awkward person.

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:19.330
So today, I'm gathering a lot of other

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:21.630
uncomfortable people and
we're gonna make them

00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:23.660
stare at each other for four minutes,

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:25.330
uninterrupted eye contact.

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:28.830
- I've been told that I am
socially awkward by friends.

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:30.540
My mom is really sweet though, she's like,

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:31.670
"You're not that bad."

00:00:31.670 --> 00:00:34.650
- I get very fidgety and
shaky around new people.

00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:37.990
- When somebody's looking
at you, you feel very seen,

00:00:37.990 --> 00:00:40.477
and I like to be very unseen.

00:00:40.477 --> 00:00:41.310
(laughs nervously)

00:00:41.310 --> 00:00:44.150
- I am not excited to
stare into eyes today.

00:00:44.150 --> 00:00:49.150
I would rather not do
that, but, we're here.

00:00:49.450 --> 00:00:51.340
- It's definitely really vulnerable,

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:53.340
and I also don't know this person at all.

00:00:53.340 --> 00:00:56.450
- I think four minutes of
uninterrupted eye contact

00:00:56.450 --> 00:00:58.530
will change me as a person.

00:00:58.530 --> 00:01:01.920
I'm not sure how, but I'm
excited to give it a go.

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:03.090
- Oh my God.

00:01:03.090 --> 00:01:05.440
I don't want to do this.

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:06.590
- [Emily] We're gonna do it.

00:01:06.590 --> 00:01:07.470
We're almost there.

00:01:07.470 --> 00:01:08.303
- (whispering) Help me Lord Jesus.

00:01:08.303 --> 00:01:09.136
- Alright.

00:01:09.136 --> 00:01:09.969
Ready.

00:01:09.969 --> 00:01:10.802
- I feel nothing.

00:01:10.802 --> 00:01:11.990
- Set.

00:01:11.990 --> 00:01:14.964
- [Female Voice] Two, one, start.

00:01:14.964 --> 00:01:18.270
(awkward music)

00:01:18.270 --> 00:01:19.552
- We can blink, right?

00:01:19.552 --> 00:01:20.385
- Yeah!

00:01:20.385 --> 00:01:21.218
- Yeah!

00:01:21.218 --> 00:01:22.320
- That would be an impossible task.

00:01:23.270 --> 00:01:24.280
- Oh my gosh.

00:01:24.280 --> 00:01:26.840
(awkward music continues)

00:01:26.840 --> 00:01:28.450
Oh God, I looked away for a second,

00:01:28.450 --> 00:01:29.283
but it's fine.

00:01:29.283 --> 00:01:30.270
- It's okay.

00:01:30.270 --> 00:01:31.760
- Eee.

00:01:31.760 --> 00:01:32.606
- Look at me.

00:01:32.606 --> 00:01:34.238
- Oh my God I don't wanna look at you!

00:01:34.238 --> 00:01:36.090
(laughing and squealing)

00:01:36.090 --> 00:01:37.110
- Open your eyes.
- (whispering) Oh my God,

00:01:37.110 --> 00:01:38.250
oh my God.

00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:39.324
- Alright just breathe.

00:01:39.324 --> 00:01:42.293
(deep breathing)

00:01:42.293 --> 00:01:45.210
(nervous giggling)

00:01:46.090 --> 00:01:47.800
- So what did you do this weekend?

00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:48.633
- Um.

00:01:50.150 --> 00:01:52.020
- I'm definitely blinking a lot.

00:01:52.020 --> 00:01:53.390
- I feel like you're not
blinking a lot at all.

00:01:53.390 --> 00:01:54.780
- Really?
- Yes.

00:01:54.780 --> 00:01:55.613
- You really aren't.
- Oh.

00:01:55.613 --> 00:01:57.030
- Yeah.
- I'm like, blinking a lot

00:01:57.030 --> 00:01:57.877
I think.

00:01:57.877 --> 00:01:58.710
- Mm-mm.

00:01:58.710 --> 00:02:00.587
Looks like, seems totally normal.

00:02:00.587 --> 00:02:01.527
- Stop it.

00:02:01.527 --> 00:02:02.798
(giggling)

00:02:02.798 --> 00:02:03.885
- I'm not doing anything!

00:02:03.885 --> 00:02:05.704
(laughing)

00:02:05.704 --> 00:02:06.780
- I mean we could do this again.

00:02:06.780 --> 00:02:07.899
- No, please!

00:02:07.899 --> 00:02:08.841
(laughing)

00:02:08.841 --> 00:02:09.674
Please!

00:02:09.674 --> 00:02:13.174
(awkward music continues)

00:02:14.231 --> 00:02:15.064
(timer chiming)

00:02:15.064 --> 00:02:16.708
(gasping)

00:02:16.708 --> 00:02:17.882
- [In Unison] We did it!

00:02:17.882 --> 00:02:19.131
Yay! (clapping)

00:02:19.131 --> 00:02:19.964
- Friendship!

00:02:19.964 --> 00:02:20.797
- We did it!
- Yay!

00:02:20.797 --> 00:02:21.828
- Yay!

00:02:21.828 --> 00:02:22.803
(clapping)

00:02:22.803 --> 00:02:24.417
- Ugh!

00:02:24.417 --> 00:02:25.760
- Oh my God.

00:02:25.760 --> 00:02:26.820
- I suddenly became aware

00:02:26.820 --> 00:02:28.549
of every part of my body.

00:02:28.549 --> 00:02:29.382
- Same!

00:02:29.382 --> 00:02:30.410
- When we could not talk.

00:02:30.410 --> 00:02:31.570
- I'm just like, oh no.

00:02:31.570 --> 00:02:32.880
- That was actually really good.

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:34.000
- Yeah, that was fun.

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:35.060
- There was like a moment in time

00:02:35.060 --> 00:02:36.410
where I felt, like, a warmness

00:02:36.410 --> 00:02:37.750
even though like, we're not friends.

00:02:37.750 --> 00:02:39.871
- I feel like I had eye sex with you.

00:02:39.871 --> 00:02:40.840
(laughter)

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:42.890
- I think I'm gonna need
some time to recover,

00:02:42.890 --> 00:02:44.950
but hopefully this will
be like, a new baseline,

00:02:44.950 --> 00:02:46.960
to be like, the four minutes was weird,

00:02:46.960 --> 00:02:48.900
this conversation is not.

00:02:48.900 --> 00:02:50.220
- I mean, now that I've done this,

00:02:50.220 --> 00:02:53.350
I feel like I'll probably hold eye contact

00:02:53.350 --> 00:02:56.970
a little longer than like,
a second with somebody.

00:02:56.970 --> 00:02:58.730
- So like, I kind of feel like I tore down

00:02:58.730 --> 00:03:01.010
a wall a little bit, which is like, weird.

00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:03.920
- I think we've shared an
intimate experience today,

00:03:03.920 --> 00:03:06.060
you know, we can't, we can't go back.

00:03:06.060 --> 00:03:08.049
We're bonded forever.

00:03:08.049 --> 00:03:08.882
Mm!

00:03:12.296 --> 00:03:13.170
(laughing)

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:14.003
- Alright, cut!

00:03:14.893 --> 00:03:17.476
(upbeat music)

00:03:20.886 --> 00:03:21.988
(squeaking)

